silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_07_sections_03_concrete_anchor_3#phaseendstageindex silm:hasLongDescription "The PhaseEndStageIndex is the last stage before the senior phase begins (year-10). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'n_phi^end', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
